  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep28. 来梅雨江南，逛园林，看展览，吃爆汁儿杨梅…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683960bc38dcc57c64c1bbdb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683960bc38dcc57c64c1bbdb</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！我们追剧组近日已经开启生活闲聊，这次要聊一个江南“特产”——黄梅天。顺便祝贺我们的粉丝破千啦！感谢听众朋友们的支持。</span></p><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">1:16</a> 黄梅天，江南梅子熟时，天气潮湿，多雨，人闷得不行啦！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">3:51</a> 对黄梅的记忆从水果开启：枇杷、荔枝再吃到杨梅，当然还有泡梅酒，以水蜜桃收尾，好吃！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> 黄梅天勇闯江南，体会文人诗中描绘的烟雨意境；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> 黄梅天能做的事儿：逛园林，还可以去室内看展呐；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> 还有哪些折磨人的怪天气：广州的回南天，北京的飞絮日；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a> 突然聊到粽子的咸甜之争，有人被粽子口味震惊到了；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2293">38:13</a> 来个图书盲盒吧~留言前3位请来公众号（文学报）小红书（文艺速效丸）；</span></p><p><span>本期主播：淼淼，方南，阿懒</span></p><p><span>剪辑：阿懒</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6539ecf28251f4e466b5b0f2/lq4nPhZv_Em-g2ES6omqPMSyAiFz.m4a" length="37864548" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmO4hXEEbCrp0H6iXDkv-R45Kr03.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
